              "newText": "EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES. EXCEPT FOR EXCLUDED CLAIMS, EACH PARTY'S TOTAL AGGREGATE LIABILITY ARISING OUT OF OR RELATING TO THIS AGREEMENT SHALL NOT EXCEED THE GREATER OF (A) THE AMOUNTS PAID OR PAYABLE BY ABBVIE TO HARPOON UNDER THIS AGREEMENT IN THE TWELVE (12) MONTHS IMMEDIATELY PRECEDING THE EVENT GIVING RISE TO THE CLAIM AND (B) ONE MILLION U.S. DOLLARS (USD 1,000,000). \"EXCLUDED CLAIMS\" MEANS A PARTY'S BREACH OF ITS OBLIGATIONS UNDER [ARTICLE 9 OR SECTION 5.8], ITS INDEMNIFICATION OBLIGATIONS UNDER THIS ARTICLE 11, ITS FRAUD, WILLFUL MISCONDUCT OR GROSS NEGLIGENCE, AND ITS INFRINGEMENT OF THE OTHER PARTY'S INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS. AMOUNTS PAYABLE BY ABBVIE UNDER ARTICLE 6 SHALL NOT CONSTITUTE DAMAGES SUBJECT TO SUCH CAP."
